                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 11,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In the past, the federal government spent $4 million of YOUR tax dollars for \u201csedentary migrants\u201d in Colombia, $3 million for sexual reproductive health in Venezuela, and $1 million for voter ID in Haiti.\n\u00a0\nThat is a waste of Americans\u2019 hard earned tax dollars. The rescissions package passed by the Senate this week restores common-sense to American aid.",
