                "reply_count": 15,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our veterans deserve our utmost respect and gratitude. In order to ensure our veterans receive the best standard of care, it is important that their medical history is shared and available for VA medical centers following care in the community.\u00a0This bill will help establish guidelines and procedures for VA medical facilities to obtain medical documentation from community care providers.",
