                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The OBBB supports rural health in Nebraska, investing in outcomes now and for future generations. Starting this week, states can apply for the Rural Health Transformation (RHT) program to receive part of the $50B allocated for rural health care in the OBBB.\u00a0That\u2019s 50% more through Medicaid for rural healthcare.\n\nNebraska partners can visit the following website to learn more: https://t.co/7ouSb4Z01g",
                "text_lang": "en",
