                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 12,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Supporting the Good Life for all Nebraskans is my top priority as Senator. One of the most important ways we can do this is by supporting rural healthcare.\n\u00a0\n@SenateGOP and @POTUS did just this by passing the OBBB into law. The OBBB created a $50 billion Rural Health Fund. This will support dependable care for Nebraskans in rural areas!",
