                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": ".@SenateGOP worked hard to deliver $50 billion in funding for rural hospitals. We cut $1.4 trillion in spending. Now, @SenateDems are trying to reverse our positive momentum to score political points. They\u2019re using the health of rural Americans as a political pawn. That is wrong.",
