                "reply_count": 16,
                "retweet_count": 17,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Schumer and his Senate Minority say their \u201cfight\u201d is about healthcare.\u00a0 That\u2019s not the case. Because of this shutdown, veterans\u2019 health services are impacted. Telehealth programs that rural and elderly Nebraskans rely on have lapsed. Those are the costs of this Schumer Shutdown.",
