                "text": "I introduced the bipartisan CARING for Our Veterans Health Act to improve information-sharing between community care providers and VA medical centers. The bill would make sure that veterans\u2019 medical history is shared and available for VA medical centers.\u00a0It would help the VA provide veterans with the standard of care they deserve.",
