                "text": "Meet Jen and Shelly from Manley. Jen and Shelly worked hard to open a daycare to meet a growing need for childcare. They applied for a federal grant through the Department of Health and Human Services. They exchanged 88 emails but continued to wait for the grant.\n\nMy team was able to cut through the red tape. Jen and Shelly got their grant in time to open their doors. Now, families in Southeast Nebraska have access to high-quality childcare closer to home.",
