                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Earlier this year, one of my constituents reached out to my office. He was frustrated with the time it takes the FAA to review medical certifications for pilots. He had waited several months for his certificate to get an upgrade.\n\nMy team was able to contact the FAA and upgrade his certificate right away. We are here to serve you!",
