                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Great to meet with Mr. Tyler Bruch and several of our heroic veterans, including two Medal of Honor recipients. These vets are strong advocates for the mental health of the women and men who served our country. \n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m working to pass the MIND Our Veterans Act. The bipartisan bill ensures that servicemembers receive effective, evidence-based mental health screenings prior to separation from active duty. Thank you for all the work you do!",
