                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our Republican majority in Congress and the White House signed the Working Family Tax Cut Act into law this year. Congress made the largest ever investment in rural healthcare.\n\nOver the next five years, grants from the new $50 billion Rural Health Transformation Program will support dependable care in rural communities.  I am fighting to make sure our healthcare providers have the resources they need.",
